        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn WPABP, Rough Iron Warwick 17\" Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large 17 inch door pull has an old world style with carefully forged crests on the top and bottom. Attention to detail is just as important on the grip, which has been skillfully engraved. Acorn's WPABP Rough Iron Pull has a finish lifetime no rust warranty. Surfaced mounted, the Warwick Handleset can be easily installed with just a few screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/17-inch-warwick-rough-iron-push-plate-acorn-wndbp\"><b>Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications</b> for the Warwick Rough Iron 17 Inch Iron Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Texture Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Width at Widest Point: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width at Narrowest Point:  1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length to Center: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Shape: Square</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually. Package includes 1 pull and hardware for a surface mounted application. All dimensions are approximate.</i>\r\n</p>",
